  volume    =  162,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "134--145",
  abstract  = "Stimuli that possess inherently rewarding or aversive qualities
               elicit emotional responses and also induce learning by imparting
               valence upon neutral sensory cues. Evidence has accumulated
