  volume    =  6,
  number    =  6,
  pages     = "823--836",
  abstract  = "The neurological basis of affective behaviours in everyday life
               is not well understood. We obtained continuous intracranial
               electroencephalography recordings from the human mesolimbic
               network in 11 participants with epilepsy and hand-annotated
               spontaneous behaviours from 116 h of multiday video recordings.
