               transcranial magnetic stimulation, multivariate pattern analysis,
               and Neurosynth analyses. The Neurosynth analyses include
               multi-term reverse inference analyses that compare several
               domains of interest to one another at once. We examine the
               evidence supporting structure-function links in five domains:
               social cognition, self, value, emotional experience, and mental
