  publisher = "American Mathematical Society (AMS)",
  volume    =  61,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "438--456",
  abstract  = "Neural networks have demonstrated impressive success in various
               domains, raising the question of what fundamental principles
               underlie the effectiveness of the best AI systems and quite
